{%- comment -%}
  Besjaar welcome offer — simple one-step version (2026-09-29).

  One card: the discount, one line of text, e-mail, one button. (2026-10-25:
  the optional first-name field was dropped; the offer only asks for the
  e-mail address.) A small tab in the lower-left corner ("Bespaar 20%") is
  visible from page load and reopens it. It opens by itself once per visit,
  15 seconds after the page loads, on the homepage and collection pages only — never on product, cart or checkout pages.

  The offer shown is the reward with the highest weight in Theme settings >
  Welcome offer (no lottery any more). It keeps the storage keys and the
  ?besjaar_offer_claimed= marker that sections/besjaar-welcome-applied.liquid
  reads, so the "discount applied" notice and the welcome prices keep working.
  Self-contained: the old besjaar-welcome-offer.css/.js assets are no longer
  loaded.

  2026-10-21 (later): two ways to the discount, told as "kies je straal":
  sign up for the mails and get the main reward (20%, "volle straal"), or
  take the 10% code without signing up ("een straaltje"). The popup has a
  navy header with a lime percentage badge and the sign-up card on top.

  2026-10-21: the tab now looks and behaves like the Google "Store quality"
  badge (a white pill that shrinks to a round icon after a few seconds) and no
  longer sits on top of that badge (Google & YouTube app embed, LEFT_BOTTOM,
  16px/46px on mobile and 36px/36px on desktop). It stands just above it, and a small
  script lifts it further whenever another fixed widget (cookie banner, sticky
  add-to-cart bar, a larger Google badge) is underneath it.

  2026-11-02: simplified on request ("simpler, fewer details"). The header
  now just names the discount ("20% korting", the percentage in lime) with
  one short line under it; the eyebrow, the "kies je straal" wordplay, the
  round lime badge, the waves, the "Beste deal" ribbon, the plan heading and
  its paragraph and the "of" divider are gone. The no-sign-up 10% is a plain
  text link under the button instead of a dashed card; choosing it swaps the
  header to "10% korting" and shows the code. The title is forced white: a
  theme-wide heading rule was turning it dark navy on the navy header.

  2026-11-04: Black Friday early access. Until Black Week starts (Sat 21 Nov
  2026, 00:00 Amsterdam) the tab and the popup no longer offer the 20%
  welcome code: they invite shoppers to sign up for early access to the Black
  Week deals ("Black Friday: vroege toegang"). There is no code and no
  no-sign-up 10%. Sign-ups get the tags newsletter and
  besjaar-bf-early-access-2026 (build the early-access e-mail segment on that
  tag) and come back to the page they were on, where the popup confirms
  "Je staat op de lijst". From 21 to 30 Nov the welcome offer is hidden, so no
  welcome code competes with the Black Week deals; from 1 Dec it returns
  exactly as before. To end it early or move the dates, change bjw_bf_starts
  / bjw_bf_ends below (a theme setting welcome_offer_bf_early_access set to
  false would also switch it off; it is not in settings_schema.json).

  2026-11-05: the Black Friday popup gives 20% off. Signing up sends the
  shopper through /discount/VROEG20-PJX6SL (20% on everything, once per
  customer, valid until Black Week starts: Sat 21 Nov 2026 00:00 Amsterdam,
  the same moment the popup switches off), so the code is already on their
  cart when they come back to the page they were on; the popup then shows the
  code with a copy button. Sign-ups also get the tag besjaar-bf-20-2026. To use
  another code, change bjw_bf_code below (the discount itself is in Shopify
  admin > Discounts: "Black Friday-popup - 20% bij aanmelding").
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign bjw_allowed = settings.welcome_offer_enabled
  if customer != blank
    assign bjw_allowed = false
  endif
  if request.design_mode or request.visual_preview_mode
    assign bjw_allowed = false
  endif
  if request.page_type == 'cart' or request.page_type == 'search' or request.page_type == '404' or request.page_type contains 'customers'
    assign bjw_allowed = false
  endif
  if request.path contains '/apps/' or request.path contains '/checkouts/' or request.path contains '/checkout'
    assign bjw_allowed = false
  endif

  assign bjw_w10 = settings.welcome_offer_weight_10 | default: 25 | plus: 0
  assign bjw_w15 = settings.welcome_offer_weight_15 | default: 55 | plus: 0
  assign bjw_w20 = settings.welcome_offer_weight_20 | default: 10 | plus: 0
  assign bjw_wship = settings.welcome_offer_weight_shipping | default: 10 | plus: 0
  assign bjw_id = '10'
  assign bjw_pct = 10
  assign bjw_code = settings.welcome_offer_code_10 | default: 'WELKOM10'
  assign bjw_w = bjw_w10
  if bjw_w15 > bjw_w
    assign bjw_id = '15'
    assign bjw_pct = 15
    assign bjw_code = settings.welcome_offer_code_15 | default: 'WELKOM15'
    assign bjw_w = bjw_w15
  endif
  if bjw_w20 > bjw_w
    assign bjw_id = '20'
    assign bjw_pct = 20
    assign bjw_code = settings.welcome_offer_code_20 | default: 'WELKOM20'
    assign bjw_w = bjw_w20
  endif
  if bjw_wship > bjw_w
    assign bjw_id = 'shipping'
    assign bjw_pct = 0
    assign bjw_code = settings.welcome_offer_code_shipping | default: 'WELKOMSHIP'
    assign bjw_w = bjw_wship
  endif
  if bjw_w <= 0 or bjw_code == blank
    assign bjw_allowed = false
  endif

  comment
    2026-10-14: the offer never opens by itself any more (it opened after 15
    seconds on the home and collection pages). The corner chip ("Save 20%")
    stays and opens it on click. 2026-10-15: chip and title now read
    Save 20% more (NL: Bespaar 20% extra) on request.
  endcomment
  assign bjw_auto = false

  assign bjw_lang = request.locale.iso_code | split: '-' | first | downcase
  case bjw_lang
    when 'en'
      assign bjw_tab = 'Save ' | append: bjw_pct | append: '% more'
      assign bjw_title = 'Save ' | append: bjw_pct | append: '% more'
      assign bjw_text = 'Sign up and get ' | append: bjw_pct | append: '% off your first Besjaar order.'
      if bjw_id == 'shipping'
        assign bjw_tab = 'Free shipping'
        assign bjw_title = 'Free shipping'
        assign bjw_text = 'Sign up and get free shipping on your first Besjaar order.'
      endif
      assign bjw_email = 'Your email address'
      assign bjw_button = 'Get my discount'
      assign bjw_note = 'By signing up you agree to receive Besjaar emails. Unsubscribe anytime.'
      assign bjw_close = 'Close'
      assign bjw_error = 'That did not work. Check your email address and try again.'
      assign bjw_c_head = '[B] off'
      assign bjw_c_head_sub = 'On your first order.'
      assign bjw_c_cta = 'Get [B] off'
      assign bjw_c_quick_btn = 'No emails? Take [S] right now'
      assign bjw_c_quick_title = '[S] off'
      assign bjw_c_quick_text = 'No sign-up needed.'
      assign bjw_c_copy = 'Copy'
      assign bjw_c_copied = 'Copied'
      assign bjw_c_apply = 'Use [S] and shop'
      assign bjw_c_back = 'Rather have [B]? Sign up with your email'
    when 'de'
      assign bjw_tab = bjw_pct | prepend: '' | append: '% extra sparen'
      assign bjw_title = bjw_pct | prepend: '' | append: '% extra sparen'
      assign bjw_text = 'Melde dich an und erhalte ' | append: bjw_pct | append: '% Rabatt auf deine erste Besjaar-Bestellung.'
      if bjw_id == 'shipping'
        assign bjw_tab = 'Gratis Versand'
        assign bjw_title = 'Gratis Versand'
        assign bjw_text = 'Melde dich an und erhalte gratis Versand auf deine erste Besjaar-Bestellung.'
      endif
      assign bjw_email = 'Deine E-Mail-Adresse'
      assign bjw_button = 'Rabatt sichern'
      assign bjw_note = 'Mit der Anmeldung erhältst du E-Mails von Besjaar. Abmelden ist jederzeit möglich.'
      assign bjw_close = 'Schließen'
      assign bjw_error = 'Das hat nicht geklappt. Prüfe deine E-Mail-Adresse und versuche es erneut.'
      assign bjw_c_head = '[B] Rabatt'
      assign bjw_c_head_sub = 'Auf deine erste Bestellung.'
      assign bjw_c_cta = '[B] Rabatt sichern'
      assign bjw_c_quick_btn = 'Keine E-Mails? Nimm sofort [S]'
      assign bjw_c_quick_title = '[S] Rabatt'
      assign bjw_c_quick_text = 'Ohne Anmeldung.'
      assign bjw_c_copy = 'Kopieren'
      assign bjw_c_copied = 'Kopiert'
      assign bjw_c_apply = '[S] nutzen und shoppen'
      assign bjw_c_back = 'Doch lieber [B]? Mit E-Mail anmelden'
    when 'fr'
      assign bjw_tab = 'Économisez ' | append: bjw_pct | append: ' % de plus'
      assign bjw_title = 'Économisez ' | append: bjw_pct | append: ' % de plus'
      assign bjw_text = 'Inscrivez-vous et recevez ' | append: bjw_pct | append: ' % de réduction sur votre première commande Besjaar.'
      if bjw_id == 'shipping'
        assign bjw_tab = 'Livraison gratuite'
        assign bjw_title = 'Livraison gratuite'
        assign bjw_text = 'Inscrivez-vous et recevez la livraison gratuite sur votre première commande Besjaar.'
      endif
      assign bjw_email = 'Votre adresse e-mail'
      assign bjw_button = 'Recevoir ma réduction'
      assign bjw_note = 'En vous inscrivant, vous acceptez de recevoir les e-mails de Besjaar. Désinscription possible à tout moment.'
      assign bjw_close = 'Fermer'
      assign bjw_error = 'Cela n’a pas fonctionné. Vérifiez votre adresse e-mail et réessayez.'
      assign bjw_c_head = '[B] de réduction'
      assign bjw_c_head_sub = 'Sur votre première commande.'
      assign bjw_c_cta = 'Obtenir [B] de réduction'
      assign bjw_c_quick_btn = 'Pas d’e-mails ? Prenez [S] tout de suite'
      assign bjw_c_quick_title = '[S] de réduction'
      assign bjw_c_quick_text = 'Sans inscription.'
      assign bjw_c_copy = 'Copier'
      assign bjw_c_copied = 'Copié'
      assign bjw_c_apply = 'Utiliser [S] et acheter'
      assign bjw_c_back = 'Plutôt [B] ? Inscrivez-vous avec votre e-mail'
    when 'es'
      assign bjw_tab = 'Ahorra un ' | append: bjw_pct | append: ' % más'
      assign bjw_title = 'Ahorra un ' | append: bjw_pct | append: ' % más'
      assign bjw_text = 'Suscríbete y recibe un ' | append: bjw_pct | append: ' % de descuento en tu primer pedido de Besjaar.'
      if bjw_id == 'shipping'
        assign bjw_tab = 'Envío gratis'
        assign bjw_title = 'Envío gratis'
        assign bjw_text = 'Suscríbete y recibe envío gratis en tu primer pedido de Besjaar.'
      endif
      assign bjw_email = 'Tu correo electrónico'
      assign bjw_button = 'Obtener mi descuento'
      assign bjw_note = 'Al suscribirte, aceptas recibir emails de Besjaar. Puedes darte de baja en cualquier momento.'
      assign bjw_close = 'Cerrar'
      assign bjw_error = 'No ha funcionado. Comprueba tu correo electrónico e inténtalo de nuevo.'
      assign bjw_c_head = '[B] de descuento'
      assign bjw_c_head_sub = 'En tu primer pedido.'
      assign bjw_c_cta = 'Obtener un [B] de descuento'
      assign bjw_c_quick_btn = '¿Sin emails? Llévate un [S] ya'
      assign bjw_c_quick_title = '[S] de descuento'
      assign bjw_c_quick_text = 'Sin suscripción.'
      assign bjw_c_copy = 'Copiar'
      assign bjw_c_copied = 'Copiado'
      assign bjw_c_apply = 'Usar el [S] y comprar'
      assign bjw_c_back = '¿Mejor un [B]? Suscríbete con tu email'
    else
      assign bjw_tab = 'Bespaar ' | append: bjw_pct | append: '% extra'
      assign bjw_title = 'Bespaar ' | append: bjw_pct | append: '% extra'
      assign bjw_text = 'Meld je aan en ontvang ' | append: bjw_pct | append: '% korting op je eerste Besjaar-bestelling.'
      if bjw_id == 'shipping'
        assign bjw_tab = 'Gratis verzending'
        assign bjw_title = 'Gratis verzending'
        assign bjw_text = 'Meld je aan en ontvang gratis verzending op je eerste Besjaar-bestelling.'
      endif
      assign bjw_email = 'Je e-mailadres'
      assign bjw_button = 'Ontvang mijn korting'
      assign bjw_note = 'Door je aan te melden ontvang je e-mails van Besjaar. Uitschrijven kan altijd.'
      assign bjw_close = 'Sluiten'
      assign bjw_error = 'Dat lukte niet. Controleer je e-mailadres en probeer het opnieuw.'
      assign bjw_c_head = '[B] korting'
      assign bjw_c_head_sub = 'Op je eerste bestelling.'
      assign bjw_c_cta = 'Geef mij [B] korting'
      assign bjw_c_quick_btn = 'Liever geen e-mail? Neem direct [S]'
      assign bjw_c_quick_title = '[S] korting'
      assign bjw_c_quick_text = 'Geen aanmelding nodig.'
      assign bjw_c_copy = 'Kopieer'
      assign bjw_c_copied = 'Gekopieerd'
      assign bjw_c_apply = 'Gebruik [S] en shop'
      assign bjw_c_back = 'Toch [B]? Meld je aan met je e-mail'
  endcase

  comment
    The tab highlights the percentage in Besjaar green. French and Spanish
    write a space before the % sign.
  endcomment
  assign bjw_hl = bjw_pct | append: '%'
  if bjw_lang == 'fr' or bjw_lang == 'es'
    assign bjw_hl = bjw_pct | append: ' %'
  endif
  assign bjw_hl_html = '<b>' | append: bjw_hl | append: '</b>'

  comment
    2026-10-21: two ways to the welcome discount. Signing up for the mails gets
    the main reward above (WELKOM20, "volle straal"); a shopper who does not
    want to sign up can take the 10% code straight away ("een straaltje").
    The quick option only shows when the main reward is a bigger percentage.
  endcomment
  assign bjw_q_id = '10'
  assign bjw_q_pct = 10
  assign bjw_q_code = settings.welcome_offer_code_10 | default: 'WELKOM10'
  assign bjw_quick = false
  if bjw_id != 'shipping' and bjw_pct > bjw_q_pct and bjw_q_code != blank
    assign bjw_quick = true
  endif
  assign bjw_big = bjw_pct | append: '%'
  assign bjw_small = bjw_q_pct | append: '%'
  if bjw_lang == 'fr' or bjw_lang == 'es'
    assign bjw_big = bjw_pct | append: ' %'
    assign bjw_small = bjw_q_pct | append: ' %'
  endif
  assign bjw_c_head = bjw_c_head | replace: '[B]', bjw_big
  assign bjw_c_cta = bjw_c_cta | replace: '[B]', bjw_big
  assign bjw_c_back = bjw_c_back | replace: '[B]', bjw_big
  assign bjw_c_quick_btn = bjw_c_quick_btn | replace: '[S]', bjw_small
  assign bjw_c_quick_title = bjw_c_quick_title | replace: '[S]', bjw_small
  assign bjw_c_apply = bjw_c_apply | replace: '[S]', bjw_small
  unless bjw_quick
    assign bjw_c_head = bjw_title
    assign bjw_c_head_sub = bjw_text
    assign bjw_c_cta = bjw_button
  endunless
  comment
    2026-11-02: the percentage in the popup title is lime, the one accent the
    simplified header keeps.
  endcomment
  assign bjw_big_html = '<span class="bjw__pct">' | append: bjw_big | append: '</span>'
  assign bjw_small_html = '<span class="bjw__pct">' | append: bjw_small | append: '</span>'

  assign bjw_target = routes.all_products_collection_url | append: '?besjaar_offer_claimed=' | append: bjw_id | url_encode
  comment
    2026-10-09: routes.root_url is '/' on the Dutch storefront but '/en', '/de',
    '/fr' and '/es' (no trailing slash) on the others, so appending 'discount/'
    sent English sign-ups to /endiscount/WELKOM20, a 404. Normalise the root
    to end in exactly one slash first.
  endcomment
  assign bjw_root = routes.root_url | append: '/' | replace: '//', '/'
  assign bjw_return_to = bjw_root | append: 'discount/' | append: bjw_code | append: '?redirect=' | append: bjw_target
  assign bjw_q_target = routes.all_products_collection_url | append: '?besjaar_offer_claimed=' | append: bjw_q_id | url_encode
  assign bjw_q_url = bjw_root | append: 'discount/' | append: bjw_q_code | append: '?redirect=' | append: bjw_q_target
-%}
{%- liquid
  comment
    2026-11-04: Black Friday early access (see the comment at the top).
    1795215600 = Sat 21 Nov 2026 00:00 Amsterdam (Black Week starts),
    1796079600 = Tue 1 Dec 2026 00:00 Amsterdam (welcome offer returns).
  endcomment
  assign bjw_bf = false
  assign bjw_bf_now = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0
  assign bjw_bf_starts = 1795215600
  assign bjw_bf_ends = 1796079600
  if settings.welcome_offer_bf_early_access != false
    if bjw_bf_now < bjw_bf_starts
      assign bjw_bf = true
    elsif bjw_bf_now < bjw_bf_ends
      assign bjw_allowed = false
    endif
  endif

  if bjw_bf
    case bjw_lang
      when 'en'
        assign bjw_tab = 'Black Friday: 20% off'
        assign bjw_bf_eyebrow = '20% off · until 20 November'
        assign bjw_c_head_sub = 'Sign up and get 20% off your whole order right now.'
        assign bjw_c_cta = 'Get 20% off'
        assign bjw_bf_done_title = 'Your 20% discount is ready'
        assign bjw_bf_done_text = 'The code is already applied to your cart. Valid until 20 November.'
        assign bjw_bf_done_btn = 'Continue shopping'
      when 'de'
        assign bjw_tab = 'Black Friday: 20% Rabatt'
        assign bjw_bf_eyebrow = '20% Rabatt · bis 20. November'
        assign bjw_c_head_sub = 'Melde dich an und erhalte schon jetzt 20% Rabatt auf deine gesamte Bestellung.'
        assign bjw_c_cta = '20% Rabatt sichern'
        assign bjw_bf_done_title = 'Dein 20%-Rabatt ist bereit'
        assign bjw_bf_done_text = 'Der Code ist bereits in deinem Warenkorb. Gültig bis 20. November.'
        assign bjw_bf_done_btn = 'Weiter einkaufen'
      when 'fr'
        assign bjw_tab = 'Black Friday : -20 %'
        assign bjw_bf_eyebrow = '-20 % · jusqu’au 20 novembre'
        assign bjw_c_head_sub = 'Inscrivez-vous et profitez dès maintenant de 20 % de réduction sur toute votre commande.'
        assign bjw_c_cta = 'Obtenir 20 % de réduction'
        assign bjw_bf_done_title = 'Vos 20 % de réduction sont prêts'
        assign bjw_bf_done_text = 'Le code est déjà appliqué à votre panier. Valable jusqu’au 20 novembre.'
        assign bjw_bf_done_btn = 'Continuer mes achats'
      when 'es'
        assign bjw_tab = 'Black Friday: 20 % de descuento'
        assign bjw_bf_eyebrow = '20 % de descuento · hasta el 20 de noviembre'
        assign bjw_c_head_sub = 'Suscríbete y consigue ya un 20 % de descuento en todo tu pedido.'
        assign bjw_c_cta = 'Quiero un 20 % de descuento'
        assign bjw_bf_done_title = 'Tu 20 % de descuento está listo'
        assign bjw_bf_done_text = 'El código ya está aplicado en tu carrito. Válido hasta el 20 de noviembre.'
        assign bjw_bf_done_btn = 'Seguir comprando'
      else
        assign bjw_tab = 'Black Friday: 20% korting'
        assign bjw_bf_eyebrow = '20% korting · t/m 20 november'
        assign bjw_c_head_sub = 'Meld je aan en krijg nu al 20% korting op je hele bestelling.'
        assign bjw_c_cta = 'Geef me 20% korting'
        assign bjw_bf_done_title = 'Je 20% korting staat klaar'
        assign bjw_bf_done_text = 'De code staat al op je winkelwagen. Geldig t/m 20 november.'
        assign bjw_bf_done_btn = 'Verder winkelen'
    endcase
    assign bjw_quick = false
    assign bjw_bf_code = 'VROEG20-PJX6SL'
    assign bjw_q_code = bjw_bf_code
    assign bjw_bf_target = request.path | append: '?besjaar_bf_signup=1' | url_encode
    assign bjw_return_to = bjw_root | append: 'discount/' | append: bjw_bf_code | append: '?redirect=' | append: bjw_bf_target
  endif
-%}
{%- if bjw_allowed -%}
